    "Confidence reminders are beeps from the Pod which can be used to acknowledge selected commands when the Pod is not silenced." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Confidence reminders are beeps from the Pod which can be used to acknowledge selected commands when the Pod is not silenced."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tillid påmindelser er bipper fra Pod som kan bruges til at anerkende valgte kommandoer, når Pod ikke er tavse."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Confidence reminders sind Signaltöne des Pods, die zur Bestätigung ausgewählter Befehle verwendet werden können, wenn der Pod nicht stummgeschaltet ist."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Confidence reminders are beeps from the Pod which can be used to acknowledge selected commands when the Pod is not silenced."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los recordatorios de confianza son pitidos del Pod que pueden ser usados para reconocer los comandos seleccionados cuando el Pod no es silenciado."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les rappels de confirmation sont des bips émis par le Pod, permettant d’accuser réception des commandes sélectionnées lorsque le Pod n’est pas en mode silencieux."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Confidence reminders are beeps from the Pod which can be used to acknowledge selected commands when the Pod is not silenced."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I promemoria di fiducia sono segnali acustici emessi dal Pod che possono essere utilizzati per confermare i comandi selezionati quando il Pod non è silenziato."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Confidence reminders are beeps from the Pod which can be used to acknowledge selected commands when the Pod is not silenced."
          }
        },
        "nb-NO" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Påminnelser er pipelyder fra Pod'en som kan brukes som bekreftelse for bestemte kommandoer når Pod'en ikke er satt i stille-modus."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dit zijn bevestigingsmeldingen met piepjes die uit de Pod komen en kunnen worden gebruikt ter bevestiging van geselecteerde opdrachten als de Pod niet gedempt is."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Powiadomienia dźwiękowe emitowane przez Pod można wykorzystać dla wybranych poleceń gdy Pod nie jest wyciszony."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lembretes de confiança são bipes do Pod que podem ser usados para reconhecer os comandos selecionados quando o Pod não é silenciado."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bekräftelseljud är pip från podden (när den inte är tystad) som kan användas som bekräftelser på utförda kommandon"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Confidence reminders are beeps from the Pod which can be used to acknowledge selected commands when the Pod is not silenced."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Сигнали підтвердження — це звукові сигнали Podʼа, які можна використовувати для підтвердження вибраних команд."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lời nhắc về độ tin cậy là những tiếng bíp từ Pod có thể được sử dụng để xác nhận các lệnh đã chọn khi Pod không ở chế độ im lặng."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "信心提醒是 Pod 發出的嗶聲，當 Pod 未靜音時，可用來確認所選指令。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Confidence reminders will sound for commands you initiate, like bolus, cancel bolus, suspend, resume, save notification reminders, etc. When the app automatically adjusts delivery, no confidence reminders are used." : {
      "comment" : "Description for BeepPreference.manualCommands",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Confidence reminders will sound for commands you initiate, like bolus, cancel bolus, suspend, resume, save notification reminders, etc. When the app automatically adjusts delivery, no confidence reminders are used."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tillid påmindelser vil lyde for kommandoer, du initierer, ligesom bolus, annullere bolus, suspendere, genoptage, gemme underretningspåmindelser osv. Når appen automatisk justerer leveringen, bruges ingen tillidspåmindelser."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Confidence reminders ertönen bei von Ihnen ausgelösten Befehlen, wie Bolus, Bolusabbruch, Unterbrechung, Wiederaufnahme, an die Speicherung von Benachrichtigungserinnerungen usw. Wenn die App die Verabreichung automatisch anpasst, werden keine Confidence reminders verwendet."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Confidence reminders will sound for commands you initiate, like bolus, cancel bolus, suspend, resume, save notification reminders, etc. When the app automatically adjusts delivery, no confidence reminders are used."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los recordatorios de confianza sonarán para comandos que inicies, como bolo, cancelar bolo, suspender, reanudar, guardar recordatorios de notificación, etc. Cuando la aplicación ajusta automáticamente la entrega, no se utilizan recordatorios de confianza."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les rappels de confirmation retentiront pour les commandes que vous initiez, comme l’envoi ou l’annulation d’un bolus, la suspension, la reprise, l’enregistrement des rappels de notification, etc. Lorsque l’application ajuste automatiquement l’administration, aucun rappel de confirmation n’est utilisé."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Confidence reminders will sound for commands you initiate, like bolus, cancel bolus, suspend, resume, save notification reminders, etc. When the app automatically adjusts delivery, no confidence reminders are used."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I promemoria di fiducia suoneranno per i comandi inoltrati, come boli, cancellazione boli, sospensioni, ripristini erogazione, salvataggi di promemoria, etc. Quando Trio invece regolerà in automatico l'erogazione allora non userà alcun promemoria di fiducia."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Confidence reminders will sound for commands you initiate, like bolus, cancel bolus, suspend, resume, save notification reminders, etc. When the app automatically adjusts delivery, no confidence reminders are used."
          }
        },
        "nb-NO" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Påminnelser vil høres for kommandoer du starter, slik som bolus, stopp bolus, pause, gjenoppta, osv. Når appen automatisk justerer insulintilførsel, lages det ingen lyd."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bevestigingsmeldingen zal piepjes afspelen voor commando's die je hebt geïnitieerd, zoals bolus, annulering, opschorting, hervatten, opslaan van meldingen etc. Als Trio automatisch de toediening wijzigt, worden er geen piepjes afgespeeld."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Powiadomienia dźwiękowe będą emitowane w przypadku poleceń, które zainicjujesz, takich jak bolus, anulowanie bolusa, wstrzymanie, wznowienie, zapisanie przypomnień o powiadomieniach itp. Kiedy Loop automatycznie dostosowuje podawanie, nie są używane żadne sygnały dźwiękowe."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lembretes de confiança soarão para os comandos que iniciar, como bolus, cancelar bolus, suspender, retomar, salvar lembretes de notificação, etc. Quando o aplicativo ajusta automaticamente a entrega, não são usados lembretes de confiança."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bekräftelseljud kommer att pipa för för ala pumpkommandon du ger, som bolus, avbryt bolus, pausa pump, återuppta insulintillförsel, spara påminnelser etc. När Trio automatiskt justerar insulintillförsel kommer inga pip att ljuda."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Confidence reminders will sound for commands you initiate, like bolus, cancel bolus, suspend, resume, save notification reminders, etc. When the app automatically adjusts delivery, no confidence reminders are used."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Нагадування про достовірність лунатимуть для команд, які ви ініціюєте, як-от болюс, скасування болюсу, призупинення, відновлення, збереження сповіщень тощо. Коли Loop автоматично регулює доставку, нагадування про довіру не використовуються."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Các tác vụ sẽ có âm thanh như khi bạn bolus, hủy bỏ bolus, tạm dừng bơm, hoạt động lại hay lưu các lời nhắc thông báo... sẽ không có âm thanh khi ứng dụng chạy tự động."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "信心提醒將在您啟動的指令上發出聲音，例如注射、取消注射、中止、恢復、儲存通知提醒等。當應用程式自動調整輸送時，則不會使用信心提醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Confidence reminders will sound when the app automatically adjusts delivery as well as for commands you initiate." : {
      "comment" : "Description for BeepPreference.extended",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
