    "Enabling this feature allows Trio to deliver insulin required using Super Micro Boluses (SMB) for 6 hours after a carb entry, regardless of whether there are active carbs on board (COB)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
