    "If your CGM readings are below the Low value or above the High value, you will receive a glucose alarm." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "If your CGM readings are below the Low value or above the High value, you will receive a glucose alarm."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hvis dine CGM-aflæsninger er under lavværdien eller over højværdien, vil du modtage en glukosealarm."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn Deine CGM-Messwerte unter dem niedrigen Wert oder über dem hohen Wert liegen, erhältst Du einen Glukosealarm."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si sus lecturas CGM están por debajo del valor bajo o por encima del valor alto, recibirá una alarma de glucosa."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vous recevrez une alarme de glucose si les mesures de votre CGM (capteur de glucose en continu) sont inférieures à la valeur basse ou supérieure à la valeur élevée."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "If your CGM readings are below the Low value or above the High value, you will receive a glucose alarm."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se le letture CGM sono al di sotto del valore Basso o al di sopra del valore Alto, riceverai un allarme di glucosio."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "If your CGM readings are below the Low value or above the High value, you will receive a glucose alarm."
          }
        },
        "nb-NO" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hvis sensor-verdier er under lavt nivå eller over høyt nivå, vil det utløses en blodsukker-alarm."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Als je CGM-waardes lager zijn dan de lage of hoger dan de hoge waarde, krijg je een glucosealarm."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jeśli odczyty CGM są niższe od wartości dolnej lub wyższe od wartości górnej, otrzymasz alarm dotyczący poziomu glikemii."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se as suas leituras CGM estiverem abaixo do valor baixo ou acima do valor alto, você receberá um alarme de glicose."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Om dina CGM-värden är under det låga värdet eller över det höga värdet får du ett glukosalarm."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "If your CGM readings are below the Low value or above the High value, you will receive a glucose alarm."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Якщо ваші CGM прочитання нижче низького значення або вище великого значення, ви отримаєте глюкозу сигнал."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nếu chỉ số CGM của bạn thấp hơn giá trị Thấp hoặc cao hơn giá trị Cao, bạn sẽ nhận được cảnh báo lượng đường huyết."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果您的 CGM 讀取值低於低值或高於高值，您將收到葡萄糖警報。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If your current basal rate is 0.8 U/hr and \"Super Bolus Percentage\" is set to 200%: 0.8 × (200 / 100) = 1.6 units will be added to your bolus recommendation." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "If your current basal rate is 0.8 U/hr and \"Super Bolus Percentage\" is set to 200%: 0.8 × (200 / 100) = 1.6 units will be added to your bolus recommendation."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hvis din aktuelle basale rate er 0,8 U/time og \"Super Bolus procent\" er sat til 200%: 0. × (200 / 100) = 1,6 enheder vil blive tilføjet til din bolus anbefaling."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn Deine aktuelle Basalrate 0,8 IE/Std. beträgt und „Superbolus-Prozentsatz“ auf 200 % eingestellt ist: 0,8 IE × (200 / 100) = 1,6 IE werden zu Deiner Bolusempfehlung hinzugefügt."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "If your current basal rate is 0.8 U/hr and \"Super Bolus Percentage\" is set to 200%: 0.8 × (200 / 100) = 1.6 units will be added to your bolus recommendation."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si votre débit basal actuel est de 0,8 U/h et que le « Pourcentage de Super Bolus » est défini à 200 % : 0,8 × (200 / 100) = 1,6 unités seront ajoutées au bolus recommandé."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "If your current basal rate is 0.8 U/hr and \"Super Bolus Percentage\" is set to 200%: 0.8 × (200 / 100) = 1.6 units will be added to your bolus recommendation."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "If your current basal rate is 0.8 U/hr and \"Super Bolus Percentage\" is set to 200%: 0.8 × (200 / 100) = 1.6 units will be added to your bolus recommendation."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "If your current basal rate is 0.8 U/hr and \"Super Bolus Percentage\" is set to 200%: 0.8 × (200 / 100) = 1.6 units will be added to your bolus recommendation."
          }
        },
        "nb-NO" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hvis din nåværende basalrate er 0,8 E/time og \"Super Bolus Prosent\" er satt til 200%: 0,8 × (200 / 100) = 1,6 enheter vil bli lagt til din bolusanbefaling."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wanneer je huidige basaalsnelheid 0,8E/u is en \"Super Boluspercentage\" op 200% staat, dan wordt: 0.8 x (200 / 100) = 1,6 eenheden toegevoegd aan je aanbevolen bolus."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jeśli aktualna dawka bazowa wynosi 0,8 U/h, a „Procent superbolusa” ustawiony jest na 200%: do zalecenia bolusa zostanie dodane 0,8 × (200 / 100) = 1,6 jednostki."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "If your current basal rate is 0.8 U/hr and \"Super Bolus Percentage\" is set to 200%: 0.8 × (200 / 100) = 1.6 units will be added to your bolus recommendation."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Om din nuvarande basal är 0,8 E/h och din \"Superbolus-procent\" är inställd till 200%: 0,8 × (200 ÷ 100) = 1,6 enheter kommer att läggas till din bolusrekommendation."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "If your current basal rate is 0.8 U/hr and \"Super Bolus Percentage\" is set to 200%: 0.8 × (200 / 100) = 1.6 units will be added to your bolus recommendation."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "If your current basal rate is 0.8 U/hr and \"Super Bolus Percentage\" is set to 200%: 0.8 × (200 / 100) = 1.6 units will be added to your bolus recommendation."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nếu tỷ lệ cơ bản hiện tại của bạn là 0,8 U/giờ và \"Super Bolus Percentage\" được đặt thành 200%: 0,8 × (200 / 100) = 1,6 đơn vị sẽ được thêm vào khuyến nghị tiêm bolus của bạn."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果你目前的基礎率為 0.8 U/hr 而「超注射百分比」設為 200%：0.8 × (200 / 100) = 1.6 單位將會被加入你的注射建議。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If your glucose target is %@ %@, Trio will use a safety threshold of %@ %@, unless you set Minimum Safety Threshold to something > %@ %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "If your glucose target is %1$@ %2$@, Trio will use a safety threshold of %3$@ %4$@, unless you set Minimum Safety Threshold to something > %5$@ %6$@."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hvis dit glucosemål er %1$@ %2$@, vil Trio anvende en sikkerhedstærskel på %3$@ %4$@, medmindre du sætter minimumssikkerhedsgrænsen til noget > %5$@ %6$@."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn Dein Glukoseziel bei %1$@ %2$@ liegt, verwendet Trio einen Sicherheitsschwellenwert von %3$@ %4$@, es sei denn, Du setzt den minimalen Sicherheitsschwellenwert auf etwas > %5$@ %6$@."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "If your glucose target is %1$@ %2$@, Trio will use a safety threshold of %3$@ %4$@, unless you set Minimum Safety Threshold to something > %5$@ %6$@."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si tu objetivo de glucosa es %1$@ %2$@, Trio usará un umbral de seguridad de %3$@ %4$@, a menos que establezca el umbral mínimo de seguridad en algo > %5$@ %6$@."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si votre cible de glucose est de %1$@ %2$@, Trio utilisera un seuil de sécurité de %3$@ %4$@, sauf si vous définissez un seuil de sécurité minimal supérieur à %5$@ %6$@."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
