      }
    },
    "Max IOB is the maximum amount of insulin on board from all sources – both basal (or SMB correction) and bolus insulin – that your loop is allowed to accumulate to treat higher-than-target BG. Unlike the other two OpenAPS safety settings (max_daily_safety_multiplier and current_basal_safety_multiplier), max_iob is set as a fixed number of units of insulin. As of now manual boluses are NOT limited by this setting. \n\n To test your basal rates during nighttime, you can modify the Max IOB setting to zero while in Closed Loop. This will enable low glucose suspend mode while testing your basal rates settings." : {
      "comment" : "\"Max IOB\"",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Max IOB is the maximum amount of insulin on board from all sources – both basal (or SMB correction) and bolus insulin – that your loop is allowed to accumulate to treat higher-than-target BG. Unlike the other two OpenAPS safety settings (max_daily_safety_multiplier and current_basal_safety_multiplier), max_iob is set as a fixed number of units of insulin. As of now manual boluses are NOT limited by this setting. \n\n To test your basal rates during nighttime, you can modify the Max IOB setting to zero while in Closed Loop. This will enable low glucose suspend mode while testing your basal rates settings."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Max IOB er den maksimale mængde insulin om bord fra alle kilder – både basal (eller SMB korrektion) og bolus insulin – at dit loop er tilladt at akkumulere til behandling af højere end mål BG. I modsætning til de to andre OpenAPS sikkerhedsindstillinger (max_daily_safety_multiplier og current_basal_safety_multiplier), er max_iob indstillet som et fast antal enheder insulin. Som nu manuelle bolusser er IKKE begrænset af denne indstilling. \n\n For at teste dine basale satser i løbet af natten, kan du ændre Max IOB indstillingen til nul, mens i Lukket Loop. Dette vil aktivere lav glukose suspendering tilstand, mens du tester dine basal satser indstillinger."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Max IOB ist die maximale Menge an Insulin aus allen Quellen (sowohl Basal, SMB-Korrektur, als auch Bolusinsulin) die Dein Loop zur Behandlung eines über dem Zielwert liegenden Glukosespiegels ansammeln darf. Im Gegensatz zu den beiden anderen OpenAPS-Sicherheitseinstellungen (max_daily_safety_multiplier und current_basal_safety_multiplier) wird max_iob als feste Anzahl von Insulineinheiten eingestellt. Ab sofort werden manuelle Boli NICHT mehr durch diese Einstellung begrenzt.\n\nUm Deine Basalraten während der Nacht zu testen, kannst Du die Einstellung \"Max IOB\" im Closed Loop auf Null setzen. Dadurch bleibt bei einem Basalratentest der Unterzuckerungsschutz von Trio aktiv."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Max IOB is the maximum amount of insulin on board from all sources – both basal (or SMB correction) and bolus insulin – that your loop is allowed to accumulate to treat higher-than-target BG. Unlike the other two OpenAPS safety settings (max_daily_safety_multiplier and current_basal_safety_multiplier), max_iob is set as a fixed number of units of insulin. As of now manual boluses are NOT limited by this setting. \n\n To test your basal rates during nighttime, you can modify the Max IOB setting to zero while in Closed Loop. This will enable low glucose suspend mode while testing your basal rates settings."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Max IOB es la cantidad máxima de insulina a bordo de todas las fuentes –tanto la corrección basal (o SMB de la corrección) como la insulina del bolo– que su Circuito Cerrado puede acumular para tratar glucemias por encima del objetivo. A diferencia de los otros dos ajustes de seguridad de OpenAPS (multiplicador_seguridad_max_diario y multiplicador_seguridad_basal_actual), max_iob se establece como un número fijo de unidades de insulina. Por ahora, los bolos manuales NO se limitan con este ajuste.\n\nPara probar sus diferentes basales durante la noche, puede modificar la configuración max_iob a cero mientras está en Circuito Cerrado. Esto activará el modo de suspensión por glucosa baja mientras prueba sus configuraciones de basal\n\n(Consejo de https://www.loopandlearn.org/freeaps-x/#open-loop)."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La valeur « IOB Max » correspond à la quantité maximale d’insuline active autorisée par la boucle, toutes sources confondues — qu’il s’agisse d’insuline basale (y compris les SMB de correction) ou d’un bolus.\nC’est la limite que votre boucle est autorisée à accumuler pour traiter une mesure de glucose supérieure à la cible.\n\nContrairement aux deux autres réglages de sécurité d’OpenAPS (max_daily_safety_multiplier et current_basal_safety_multiplier), max_iob est défini comme une valeur fixe en unités d’insuline.\nLes bolus manuels ne sont PAS limités par ce réglage pour le moment.\n\nPour tester votre profil basal la nuit, vous pouvez régler « IOB Max » à zéro en mode boucle fermée. Cela activera le mode de suspension en cas de glucose bas, ce qui permet d’évaluer vos réglages de basal sans que la boucle n’envoie d’insuline correctrice."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Max IOB is the maximum amount of insulin on board from all sources – both basal (or SMB correction) and bolus insulin – that your loop is allowed to accumulate to treat higher-than-target BG. Unlike the other two OpenAPS safety settings (max_daily_safety_multiplier and current_basal_safety_multiplier), max_iob is set as a fixed number of units of insulin. As of now manual boluses are NOT limited by this setting. \n\n To test your basal rates during nighttime, you can modify the Max IOB setting to zero while in Closed Loop. This will enable low glucose suspend mode while testing your basal rates settings."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La quantità massima di IOB è la quantità massima di insulina in circolo da tutte le fonti – sia la correzione basale (o SMB) che l’insulina proveniente da boli – che in ogni ciclo può accumularsi per trattare la glicemia superiore al target. A differenza delle altre due impostazioni di sicurezza OpenAPS (max_daily_safety_multiplier e current_basal_safety_multiplier), max_iob è impostato come un numero fisso di unità di insulina. Da ora in poi i boli manuali NON sono limitati da questa impostazione. \n\n Per testare le tue basali durante la notte, puoi modificare l'impostazione di Max IOB a zero mentre sei in Closed Loop. Questo abiliterà la modalità di sospensione dell’infusione per glicemia bassa durante il test delle impostazioni delle basali\n\n(Tip da https://www.loopandlearn.org/freeaps-x/#open-loop)."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Max IOB is the maximum amount of insulin on board from all sources – both basal (or SMB correction) and bolus insulin – that your loop is allowed to accumulate to treat higher-than-target BG. Unlike the other two OpenAPS safety settings (max_daily_safety_multiplier and current_basal_safety_multiplier), max_iob is set as a fixed number of units of insulin. As of now manual boluses are NOT limited by this setting. \n\n To test your basal rates during nighttime, you can modify the Max IOB setting to zero while in Closed Loop. This will enable low glucose suspend mode while testing your basal rates settings."
          }
        },
        "nb-NO" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Maks IOB er den maksimale mengden aktivt insulin fra alle kilder – både basal- (eller SMB-korreksjon) og bolusinsulin – som Trio får lov til å akkumulere for å behandle BS som er høyere enn målet. I motsetning til de to andre OpenAPS-sikkerhetsinnstillingene (max_daily_safety_multiplier og current_basal_safety_multiplier), er Maks IOB satt som et fast antall enheter insulin. Per nå er manuelle boluser IKKE begrenset av denne innstillingen.\n\nFor å teste basaldosene dine om natten, kan du endre Maks IOB-innstillingen til 0 mens du er i lukket loop. Dette vil aktivere en modus som kun stopper insulintilførsel ved lavt blodsukker mens du tester basalhastighetsinnstillingene."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "De Max IOB is de maximale hoeveelheid actieve insuline (IOB) van alle bronnen - zowel basaal (of SMB correcties) en bolus insuline die door Trio gegeven mag worden om alles hoger dan de streefwaarde te behandelen. Anders dan de andere twee veiligheid instelingen (max_daily_safety_multiplier en current_basal_safety_multiplier) wordt bij deze instelling een vaste aantal eenheden insuline opgegeven. Voorlopig worden handmatige bolussen NIET beperkt door deze instelling.\n\nOm je basaal waarden te testen gedurende de nacht kun je deze instelling op 0 zetten tijdens een actieve Loop. Dit zorgt ervoor dat stop voor laag geactiveerd worden wanneer je je instelling aan het testen bent.\n\n(Tip van https://www.loopandlearn.org/freeaps-x/#open-loop)."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Maks. IOB to maksymalna ilość aktywnej insuliny ze wszystkich źródeł - zarówno bazy (lub korekty SMB), jak i insuliny z bolusów - którą pętla może kumulować się w celu leczenia wyższego niż docelowy stężenia BG. W przeciwieństwie do pozostałych dwóch ustawień bezpieczeństwa OpenAPS (max_daily_safety_multiplier i current_basal_safety_multiplier), max_iob jest ustawiony jako stała liczba jednostek insuliny. Od teraz ręczne bolusy NIE są ograniczone przez to ustawienie. \n\n Aby przetestować swoje dawki bazowe w nocy, możesz zmodyfikować ustawienie Max IOB do zera w zamkniętej pętli. Spowoduje to włączenie trybu zawieszania niskiej glikemii podczas testowania ustawień dawki podstawowej."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Max IOB is the maximum amount of insulin on board from all sources – both basal (or SMB correction) and bolus insulin – that your loop is allowed to accumulate to treat higher-than-target BG. Unlike the other two OpenAPS safety settings (max_daily_safety_multiplier and current_basal_safety_multiplier), max_iob is set as a fixed number of units of insulin. As of now manual boluses are NOT limited by this setting. \n\n To test your basal rates during nighttime, you can modify the Max IOB setting to zero while in Closed Loop. This will enable low glucose suspend mode while testing your basal rates settings."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Max IOB är den maximalt tillåtna mängden aktivt insulin från alla källor – basal, SMB och bolusinsulin – som din loop tillåts att ackumulera för att behandla ett högt glukosvärde. Till skillnad från de andra två säkerhetsinställningarna i Trio ('Multiplikator för dygnets högsta basaldos' samt 'Multiplikator för nuvarande ordinarie basal'), är 'Max IOB' inställd som ett fast gräns på antal insulinenheter. OBS! I nuläget är manuella bolusar inte begränsade av denna inställning.\n\n Om du vill testa dina basaldoser säkert nattetid kan du ställa in Max IOB till 0 samtidigt som du kör sluten loop. Detta gör att Trio kan sänka eller stänga av basalinsulin om det skulle behövas, för att undika låga blodglukosvärden.\n\n(Tips från https://www.loopandlearn.org/freeaps-x/#open-loop)."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Max IOB is the maximum amount of insulin on board from all sources – both basal (or SMB correction) and bolus insulin – that your loop is allowed to accumulate to treat higher-than-target BG. Unlike the other two OpenAPS safety settings (max_daily_safety_multiplier and current_basal_safety_multiplier), max_iob is set as a fixed number of units of insulin. As of now manual boluses are NOT limited by this setting. \n\n To test your basal rates during nighttime, you can modify the Max IOB setting to zero while in Closed Loop. This will enable low glucose suspend mode while testing your basal rates settings."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Макс IOB - це максимальна кількість інсуліну на борту з усіх джерел - як базального (або корекції болюсів), так і болюсного інсуліну - який ваш цикл може накопичувати для компенсації високого BG. На відміну від двох інших параметрів безпеки (max_daily_safety_multiplier та current_basal_safety_multiplier), max_iob встановлюється як фіксована кількість одиниць інсуліну. На даний момент ручні болюси не обмежені цією настройкою. Для тестування базальних швидкостей у нічний час, ви можете змінити значення цього параметра на нуль, перебуваючи в замкнутому циклі. Це увімкне режим припинення на низькому цукрі, при тестуванні налаштувань базальних швидкостей. (https://www.loopandlearn.org/freeaps-x/#open-loop)."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "IOB Max là lượng insulin tối đa được cung cấp từ tất cả các nguồn – cả insulin cơ bản (hoặc hiệu chỉnh SMB) và insulin bolus – mà vòng lặp của bạn được phép tích lũy để điều trị BG cao hơn mục tiêu. Không giống như hai cài đặt an toàn OpenAPS khác (Hệ số tối đa an toàn hàng ngày và Hệ số an toàn cơ bản hiện tại), Tối đa IOB được đặt thành số lượng đơn vị insulin cố định. Tính đến thời điểm hiện tại, việc tiêm liều thủ công KHÔNG bị giới hạn bởi cài đặt này. \n\n Để kiểm tra lãi suất cơ bản của bạn vào ban đêm, bạn có thể sửa đổi cài đặt IOB tối đa thành 0 khi ở Vòng kín. Điều này sẽ kích hoạt chế độ tạm ngưng lượng đường huyết thấp trong khi kiểm tra cài đặt tốc độ cơ bản của bạn\n\n(Mẹo từ https://www.loopandlearn.org/freeaps-x/#open-loop)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最大IOB是來自所有來源的胰島素（包括基礎胰島素和注射胰島素）中允許累積以治療高於目標血糖的最大胰島素量。與其他兩個OpenAPS安全設定（max_daily_safety_multiplier和current_basal_safety_multiplier）不同，max_iob設為固定的胰島素單位數。現在手動注射不受此設定限制。\n\n 在封閉迴路中測試晚間的基礎率時，可以將最大IOB設為零。這將在測試基礎率設定時啟用低血糖暫停模式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Max IOB sets a safety limit on how much insulin Trio can automatically deliver above your scheduled basal rates. This prevents the system from giving too much insulin at once." : {

    },
    "Max Meal Absorption Time" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Max Meal Absorption Time"
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Max Måltid Absorptionstid"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Max Mahlzeiten-Absorptionszeit"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tiempo máximo de absorción de la comida"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
