    },
    "This enables supermicrobolus (SMB) with eating soon / low temp targets. With this feature enabled, any temporary target below 100mg/dL, such as a temp target of 99 (or 80, the typical eating soon target) will enable SMB." : {
      "comment" : "\"Enable SMB With Temptarget”",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This enables supermicrobolus (SMB) with eating soon / low temp targets. With this feature enabled, any temporary target below 100mg/dL, such as a temp target of 99 (or 80, the typical eating soon target) will enable SMB."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dette muliggør supermikrobolus (SMB) med at spise snart / lave temp mål. Med denne funktion aktiveret, ethvert midlertidigt mål under 100 mg/dL, såsom et temp mål på 99 (eller 80, den typiske spise snart mål) vil gøre det muligt for SMB."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dies ermöglicht Supermikroboli (SMB) mit für baldiges Essen / niedrige Temporäre Ziele. Wenn diese Funktion aktiviert ist, wird jedes Temporäre Ziel unter 100 mg/dL, wie z. B. ein Temporäres Ziel von 99 (oder 80, das typische Ziel für \"baldiges Essen\"), SMB aktivieren."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This enables supermicrobolus (SMB) with eating soon / low temp targets. With this feature enabled, any temporary target below 100mg/dL, such as a temp target of 99 (or 80, the typical eating soon target) will enable SMB."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esto activa supermicrobolos (SMB) con 'Comer Pronto' o basales temporales bajas.\nCon esta característica activada, cualquier objetivo temporal por debajo de 100mg/dL, tal como un objetivo temporal de 99 (u 80, el objetivo típico de 'Comer Pronto') se permitirán SMB."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cela active les Super Micro Bolus (SMB) en présence d’une Cible Temporaire basse, comme celle utilisée pour un repas imminent. Une fois cette option activée, toute Cible Temporaire inférieure à 100 mg/dL — comme une cible de 99 ou de 80 (valeur typique pour un repas imminent) — activera les SMB."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This enables supermicrobolus (SMB) with eating soon / low temp targets. With this feature enabled, any temporary target below 100mg/dL, such as a temp target of 99 (or 80, the typical eating soon target) will enable SMB."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Questo abilita supermicrobolo (SMB) con funzione eating soon / obiettivi temporanei glicemici bassi. Con questa funzione abilitata, qualsiasi obiettivo temporaneo inferiore a 100 mg/dL, come un obiettivo di temperatura di 99 (o 80, il tipico target eating soon) abiliterà SMB."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This enables supermicrobolus (SMB) with eating soon / low temp targets. With this feature enabled, any temporary target below 100mg/dL, such as a temp target of 99 (or 80, the typical eating soon target) will enable SMB."
          }
        },
        "nb-NO" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dette slår på Super Mikro Bolus (SMB) ved spise-snart / lave midlertidige mål. Med denne funksjonen på, vil SMB bli slått på med midlertidige mål under 100mg/dL, slik som 99 (eller 80, et typisk mål for spise-snart)."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dit maakt kleine microbolussen (SMB, supermicrobolus) mogelijk wanneer \"eating soon/pre-maaltijd\" of een lage tijdelijke streefwaarde is ingesteld. Als dit is ingesteld zal elke tijdelijke streefwaarde onder 100mg/dL (5.5 mmol/l) bijvoorbeeld 5.4 (of 4.5, de typische pre-maaltijd streefwaarde) SMB inschakelen."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Włącza supermikrobolus (SMB) z jedzeniem wkrótce / niskim celem tymczasowym. Gdy funkcja jest włączona, dowolny tymczasowy cel poniżej 100 mg/dL, taki jak cel tymczasowy 99 (lub 80 - typowy cel do szybkiego jedzenia) umożliwi SMB."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Isto permite que supermicrobolus (SMB) coma em breve / alvos temporários baixos. Com este recurso ativado, qualquer alvo temporário abaixo de 100mg/dL como um alvo temporário de 99 (ou 80, a comida típica em breve) permitirá que as pequenas e médias empresas."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Detta tillåter supermikrobolusar (SMB) vid låga tillfälliga målvärden (tex 'Äter snart'). Med denna funktion aktiverad, kommer SMB:ar vara aktiva även vid tillfälliga målvärden under 100mg/dL (5,6 mmol/l)."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This enables supermicrobolus (SMB) with eating soon / low temp targets. With this feature enabled, any temporary target below 100mg/dL, such as a temp target of 99 (or 80, the typical eating soon target) will enable SMB."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Дозволяє супермікроболюси (SMB) з режимом скоро їжа / низькими цілями. При включеній опції будь-яка тимчасова мета нижче 5.6ммоль/л (100mg/dL), наприклад, тимчасова мета 5.5 (або 4.4, типова для швидкого прийому їжі) дозволить SMB."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Điều này cho phép supermicrobolus (SMB) đạt được mục tiêu ăn sớm / nhiệt độ thấp. Khi tính năng này được bật, mọi mục tiêu tạm thời dưới 100mg/dL, chẳng hạn như mục tiêu tạm thời là 99 (hoặc 80, mục tiêu ăn sớm thông thường) sẽ kích hoạt SMB."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這使得超微量注射(SMB)在即將進餐/低目標值時啟用。啟用此功能後，任何低於100mg/dL的臨時目標，例如99（或80，通常的進餐目標），都將啟用SMB。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This enables uploading of statistics.json to Nightscout, which can be used by the Community Statistics and Demographics Project.\n\nParticipation in Community Statistics is opt-in, and requires separate registration at:\n" : {
