    "This is the maximum amount of Insulin On Board (IOB) above profile basal rates from all sources - positive temporary basal rates, manual or meal boluses, and SMBs - that Trio is allowed to accumulate to address an above target glucose." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This is the maximum amount of Insulin On Board (IOB) above profile basal rates from all sources - positive temporary basal rates, manual or meal boluses, and SMBs - that Trio is allowed to accumulate to address an above target glucose."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dette er den maksimale mængde af Insulin On Board (IOB) over profil basal rater fra alle kilder - positive midlertidige basale rater, manuelle bolus- eller måltider, og SMB'er - at Trio får lov til at akkumulere til at behandle en over målglukose."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dies ist das obere Limit an Insulin, das von Trio an aktivem Insulin abgegeben werden darf, um auf einen Blutzucker über dem Ziel zu reagieren. Hierzu wird das Insulin aus allen Quellen berücksichtigt, wie zum Beispiel positive Temporäre Basalraten, manuelle oder Mahlzeiten-Boli und SMBs."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta es la cantidad máxima de Insulin On Board (IOB) por encima de las tasas basales del perfil de todas las fuentes - las tasas basales temporales positivas bolos manuales o de comida, y SMBs - que Trio puede acumularse para abordar una glucosa objetivo arriba."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il s’agit de la quantité maximale d’insuline active (IOB) au-delà du profil basal, toutes sources confondues — débits basaux temporaires positifs, bolus manuels ou bolus de repas, et Super Micro Bolus (SMB) — que Trio est autorisé à accumuler pour corriger une mesure de glucose supérieure à la cible."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This is the maximum amount of Insulin On Board (IOB) above profile basal rates from all sources - positive temporary basal rates, manual or meal boluses, and SMBs - that Trio is allowed to accumulate to address an above target glucose."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Questa è la quantità massima di Insulina On Board (IOB) al di sopra dei tassi basali del profilo da tutte le fonti - tassi basali temporanei positivi, boli manuali o a pasto, e le piccole e medie imprese - che Trio è permesso accumulare per affrontare un sopra di glucosio bersaglio."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This is the maximum amount of Insulin On Board (IOB) above profile basal rates from all sources - positive temporary basal rates, manual or meal boluses, and SMBs - that Trio is allowed to accumulate to address an above target glucose."
          }
        },
        "nb-NO" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dette er den maksimale mengden aktivt insulin (IOB) over profilens basalrate, som Trio har lov til å akkumulere for å behandle et høyt blodsukker. Aktivt insulin (IOB) inkluderer midlertidige basalrater, måltidsbolus, manuell bolus og SMB."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dit is de maximale hoeveelheid actieve insuline (IOB) boven de profiel-basaalsnelheden van alle bronnen - positieve tijdelijke basaalsnelheden, handmatige- of maaltijdbolussen en SMB's - die Trio mag opstapelen om een glucosewaarde boven het streefdoel op te lossen."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jest to maksymalna ilość insuliny w organizmie (IOB) powyżej profilu dawek bazowych ze wszystkich źródeł - dodatnie tymczasowe dawki podstawowe, ręczne lub posiłkowe bolusy i SMB - że Trio może kumulować się w celu usunięcia powyżej docelowego glukozy."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta é a quantidade máxima de Insulina a bordo (IOB) acima das taxas basais do perfil de todas as fontes - taxas basais temporárias positivas, bolsos manuais ou de refeição e SMBs - que Trio pode acumular para endereçar um glicose alvo acima."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Detta är den maximala mängden aktivt insulin (IOB) utöver profilbasal från alla källor - ökad tillfällig basal, manuell bolus eller måltidsbolus, samt SMB:er - som Trio tillåts ackumulera för att hantera höga glukosvärden."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This is the maximum amount of Insulin On Board (IOB) above profile basal rates from all sources - positive temporary basal rates, manual or meal boluses, and SMBs - that Trio is allowed to accumulate to address an above target glucose."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Це максимальна кількість Insulin On Board (IOB) над базовими ставками профілю з усіх джерел - позитивна тимчасова базова ставка, ручний або їжачий болти та МСП - тому племені дозволено накопичувати у вирішенні вище цільової глюкози."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Đây là lượng Insulin On Board (IOB) tối đa vượt quá mức cấu hình liều cơ bản từ mọi nguồn - mức cơ bản tạm thời dương tính, liều tiêm thủ công hoặc liều tiêm trong bữa ăn và SMB - mà Trio được phép tích lũy để giải quyết tình trạng đường huyết cao hơn mục tiêu."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這是Trios允許的胰島素在所有來源中（包括正向臨時基礎率、手動或餐前注射、超微量注射）所能積累的超過設定基礎率的最大胰島素量，用以應對血糖超標的情況。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is the maximum basal rate allowed to be set or scheduled. This applies to both automatic and manual basal rates." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
