    },
    "This setting helps prevent delivering too much insulin at once. It’s typically a value close to the amount you might need for a very high blood sugar and the biggest meal of your life combined." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This setting helps prevent delivering too much insulin at once. It’s typically a value close to the amount you might need for a very high blood sugar and the biggest meal of your life combined."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Denne indstilling hjælper med at forhindre dosering af for meget insulin på én gang. Det er typisk en værdi tæt på den mængde, du har brug for et meget højt blodsukker og det største måltid du kan forestille dig kombineret."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diese Einstellung trägt dazu bei, dass nicht zu viel Insulin auf einmal abgegeben wird. Dieser Wert entspricht in der Regel der Menge, die Du bei einem sehr hohen Blutzucker kombiniert mit der größten Mahlzeit Deines Lebens benötigen würdest."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This setting helps prevent delivering too much insulin at once. It’s typically a value close to the amount you might need for a very high blood sugar and the biggest meal of your life combined."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ce réglage permet d’éviter d’administrer trop d’insuline en une seule fois. La valeur est généralement proche de celle dont vous auriez besoin en cas d’hyperglycémie très élevée combinée au repas le plus copieux de votre vie."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This setting helps prevent delivering too much insulin at once. It’s typically a value close to the amount you might need for a very high blood sugar and the biggest meal of your life combined."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This setting helps prevent delivering too much insulin at once. It’s typically a value close to the amount you might need for a very high blood sugar and the biggest meal of your life combined."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This setting helps prevent delivering too much insulin at once. It’s typically a value close to the amount you might need for a very high blood sugar and the biggest meal of your life combined."
          }
        },
        "nb-NO" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Denne innstillingen bidrar til å forhindre at det gis for mye insulin samtidig. Den setts typisk til mengden som trengs for å få ned et veldig høyt blodsukker pluss mengden som trengs for å håndtere det største måltidet du noen gang har spist."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deze instelling voorkomt te veel insuline toe te dienen. Het is meestal een waarde die overeenkomt met het de hoeveelheid dat je nodig hebt voor een zeer hoge bloedsuiker en de grootste maaltijd van je leven samen."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "To ustawienie pomaga uniknąć podawania zbyt dużej dawki insuliny jednorazowo. Zazwyczaj jest to wartość zbliżona do ilości potrzebnej dla bardzo dużego stężenia cukru we krwi i największego posiłku razem wziętych."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This setting helps prevent delivering too much insulin at once. It’s typically a value close to the amount you might need for a very high blood sugar and the biggest meal of your life combined."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Denna inställning hjälper till att förhindra att för mycket insulin levereras på en gång. Det är typiskt ett värde nära den mängd du kan behöva vid ett mycket högt blodsocker och en mycket stor måltid kombinerat."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This setting helps prevent delivering too much insulin at once. It’s typically a value close to the amount you might need for a very high blood sugar and the biggest meal of your life combined."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This setting helps prevent delivering too much insulin at once. It’s typically a value close to the amount you might need for a very high blood sugar and the biggest meal of your life combined."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cài đặt này giúp ngăn ngừa việc cung cấp quá nhiều insulin cùng một lúc. Thông thường, giá trị này gần với lượng bạn có thể cần cho lượng đường trong máu rất cao và bữa ăn lớn nhất của bạn cộng lại."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此設定有助於防止一次傳送過多的胰島素。通常這是一個接近您對於非常高血糖和您一生中最大餐點所需量的數值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This setting helps the system estimate how much glucose your body is absorbing, even when it's not immediately visible in your glucose data, ensuring more accurate insulin dosing during carb absorption." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This setting helps the system estimate how much glucose your body is absorbing, even when it's not immediately visible in your glucose data, ensuring more accurate insulin dosing during carb absorption."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Denne indstilling hjælper systemet med at vurdere, hvor meget glukose din krop absorberer, selv når det ikke umiddelbart er synligt i dine glukosedata, sikrer en mere præcis insulindosering under absorptionen af kulhydraterne."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mit dieser Einstellung kann das System abschätzen, wie viel Glukose Dein Körper aufnimmt, auch wenn dies in Deinen Glukosedaten nicht sofort sichtbar ist. Dies gewährleistet eine genauere Insulindosierung während der Kohlenhydrataufnahme."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Este ajuste ayuda al sistema a estimar cuánta glucosa está absorbiendo, incluso cuando no es visible inmediatamente en sus datos de glucosa, garantizando una dosis de insulina más precisa durante la absorción de glúcidos."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ce réglage aide le système à estimer la quantité de glucose que votre corps absorbe, même si cela n’est pas immédiatement visible dans les mesures de glucose, afin d’assurer un dosage d’insuline plus précis pendant l’absorption des glucides."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This setting helps the system estimate how much glucose your body is absorbing, even when it's not immediately visible in your glucose data, ensuring more accurate insulin dosing during carb absorption."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Questa impostazione aiuta il sistema a stimare quanto glucosio il vostro corpo sta assorbendo, anche quando non è immediatamente visibile nei dati relativi al glucosio, garantendo una dose di insulina più accurata durante l’assorbimento del carboidrato."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This setting helps the system estimate how much glucose your body is absorbing, even when it's not immediately visible in your glucose data, ensuring more accurate insulin dosing during carb absorption."
          }
        },
        "nb-NO" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Denne innstillingen hjelper systemet med å anslå hvor mye glukose kroppen din absorberer, selv om det ikke er synlig i glukosedataene dine, og gir en mer nøyaktig insulindosering under karbohydratabsorpsjonen."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deze instelling helpt bij het inschatten van de hoeveelheid glucose die je lichaam absorbeert, Zelfs wanneer de insulinedosis niet direct zichtbaar is in jouw glucosegegevens, wat zorgt voor nauwkeurigere insulinedozing tijdens het opnemen van koolhydraten."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "To ustawienie pomaga systemowi oszacować, ile glukozy wchłania Twój organizm, nawet jeśli nie jest to od razu widoczne w danych dotyczących glikemii, co zapewnia dokładniejsze dawkowanie insuliny podczas wchłaniania węglowodanów."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta configuração ajuda o sistema a estimar quanta glicose seu corpo está absorvendo, Mesmo quando não estiver imediatamente visível em seus dados de glicose, garantindo uma dosagem de insulina mais precisa durante a absorção de carbos."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Denna inställning hjälper systemet uppskatta hur mycket glukos din kropp absorberar, även när det inte omedelbart syns i dina glukosdata, vilket säkerställer mer exakt insulindosering under pågående kolhydratabsorption."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This setting helps the system estimate how much glucose your body is absorbing, even when it's not immediately visible in your glucose data, ensuring more accurate insulin dosing during carb absorption."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Цей параметр допомагає системі оцінити, скільки глюкози вашого тіла поглинає, навіть коли його не видно у вашій інформації про глюкозу, забезпечення точнішого досингу інсуліну під час поглинання тесла."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Thiết lập này giúp hệ thống ước tính lượng đường huyết mà cơ thể bạn hấp thụ, ngay cả khi lượng đường huyết này không hiển thị ngay trong dữ liệu đường huyết, đảm bảo liều lượng insulin chính xác hơn trong quá trình hấp thụ carb."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這個設定幫助系統估計你的身體吸收的葡萄糖量，即使在你的血糖數據中不立即可見，確保在碳水化合物吸收期間更精確的胰島素劑量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
