    "Trio is designed to help manage your diabetes efficiently. To get the most out of the app, we'll guide you through setting up some essential parameters." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Trio is designed to help manage your diabetes efficiently. To get the most out of the app, we'll guide you through setting up some essential parameters."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Trio er designet til at hjælpe med at styre din diabetes effektivt. For at få mest muligt ud af appen, vil vi guide dig gennem opsætning af nogle væsentlige parametre."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Trio wurde entwickelt, um Dich bei Deinem Diabetes Management zu unterstützen. Um die besten Ergebnisse mit der App zu erzielen, begleiten wir Dich durch das Erst-Setup bei dem Du grundlegende Parameter einstellst."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Trio is designed to help manage your diabetes efficiently. To get the most out of the app, we'll guide you through setting up some essential parameters."
