          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Trio is designed to help manage your diabetes efficiently. To get the most out of the app, we'll guide you through setting up some essential parameters."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Trio är utformad för att hjälpa till att hantera din diabetes effektivt. För att få ut det mesta av appen guidar vi dig genom att konfigurera några viktiga parametrar."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Trio is designed to help manage your diabetes efficiently. To get the most out of the app, we'll guide you through setting up some essential parameters."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Trio is designed to help manage your diabetes efficiently. To get the most out of the app, we'll guide you through setting up some essential parameters."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Trio được thiết kế để giúp bạn quản lý bệnh tiểu đường hiệu quả. Để tận dụng tối đa ứng dụng, chúng tôi sẽ hướng dẫn bạn thiết lập một số thông số cần thiết."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Trio 設計用於有效管理糖尿病。為了充分利用這款應用程式，我們將指導你設置一些基本參數。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trio is still fully functional and will adapt quickly — but your awareness right now helps it keep you safer." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Trio is still fully functional and will adapt quickly — but your awareness right now helps it keep you safer."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Trio er stadig fuldt funktionsdygtigt og vil hurtigt tilpasse sig – men din opmærksomhed hjælper dig lige nu med at holde dig mere sikker."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Trio ist noch voll funktionsfähig und wird sich schnell anpassen - aber wenn Du jetzt aufmerksam bist, hilft es Dir, sicherer zu werden."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
