    "Uses a combined range of all possible forecasts from the OpenAPS lines and provides you with a range of possible forecasts. This option has shown to reduce confusion and stress around algorithm forecasts by providing a less concerning visual representation." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Uses a combined range of all possible forecasts from the OpenAPS lines and provides you with a range of possible forecasts. This option has shown to reduce confusion and stress around algorithm forecasts by providing a less concerning visual representation."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bruger en kombineret vifte af alle mulige prognoser fra OpenAPS linjer og giver dig en række mulige prognoser. Denne mulighed har vist sig at reducere forvirring og stress omkring algoritme prognoser ved at give en mindre om visuel repræsentation."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Verwendet einen kombinierten Bereich aller möglichen Vorhersagen aus den OpenAPS-Linien und bietet Dir eine Reihe von möglichen Vorhersagen. Es hat sich gezeigt, dass diese Option Verwirrung und Stress im Zusammenhang mit Algorithmusvorhersagen verringert, da sie eine weniger beunruhigende visuelle Darstellung bietet."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Utiliza un rango combinado de todas las previsión posibles de las líneas OpenAPS y le proporciona una gama de predisposiciones posibles. Esta opción ha demostrado reducir la confusión y el estrés en torno a los pronósticos del algoritmo proporcionando una menor representación visual."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Utilise un intervalle combiné de toutes les prévisions possibles issues des lignes d’OpenAPS, et vous présente une plage de prévisions potentielles. Cette option a démontré qu’elle réduit la confusion et le stress liés aux prévisions de l’algorithme, en offrant une représentation visuelle moins inquiétante."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Uses a combined range of all possible forecasts from the OpenAPS lines and provides you with a range of possible forecasts. This option has shown to reduce confusion and stress around algorithm forecasts by providing a less concerning visual representation."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Utilizza una gamma combinata di tutte le possibili previsioni dalle linee OpenAPS e fornisce una serie di possibili previsioni. Questa opzione ha dimostrato di ridurre la confusione e lo stress intorno alle previsioni algoritmiche, fornendo un meno per quanto riguarda la rappresentazione visiva."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Uses a combined range of all possible forecasts from the OpenAPS lines and provides you with a range of possible forecasts. This option has shown to reduce confusion and stress around algorithm forecasts by providing a less concerning visual representation."
          }
        },
        "nb-NO" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bruker et kombinert utvalg av alle mulige prognoser fra OpenAPS-linjene og gir deg et utvalg av mulige prognoser. Dette alternativet har vist seg å redusere forvirring og stress rundt algoritmiske prognoser ved å gi en mindre bekymringsfull visuell representasjon."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gebruikt een gecombineerd bereik van alle mogelijke voorspellingen van de OpenAPS-lijnen en biedt u een reeks mogelijke voorspellingen. Deze optie heeft de verwarring en de stress rond de voorspellingen van het algoritme verminderd, door een minder over de visuele representatie te bieden."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Używa łącznego zakresu wszystkich możliwych prognoz z linii OpenAPS i zapewnia szereg możliwych prognoz. Wykazano, że opcja ta zmniejsza dezorientację i nacisk wokół prognoz algorytmu poprzez zmniejszenie liczby reprezentacji wizualnej."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Usa um intervalo combinado de todas as previsões possíveis a partir das linhas do OpenAPS e fornece a você um intervalo de previsões possíveis. Esta opção mostrou-se para reduzir a confusão e o stress em torno de previsões de algoritmos, fornecendo uma representação visual menos relativa."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Använder samtliga underliggande OpenAPS-prognoslinjer och ger dig en samlad helhetsbild. Detta alternativ kan minska förvirring och onödig stress genom att ge en balanserad visuell representation jämfört med de mer komplexa individuella prognoslinjerna."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Uses a combined range of all possible forecasts from the OpenAPS lines and provides you with a range of possible forecasts. This option has shown to reduce confusion and stress around algorithm forecasts by providing a less concerning visual representation."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Використовує комбінований спектр всіх можливих прогнозів з OpenAPS ліній і надає вам широкий спектр можливих прогнозів. Цей варіант показаний для зменшення плутанини та стресу навколо алгоритмів прогнозів, забезпечуючи менше стосовно візуального представлення."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sử dụng phạm vi kết hợp của tất cả các dự báo có thể từ các dòng OpenAPS và cung cấp cho bạn phạm vi các dự báo có thể. Tùy chọn này đã được chứng minh là làm giảm sự nhầm lẫn và căng thẳng xung quanh các dự báo thuật toán bằng cách cung cấp một biểu diễn trực quan ít gây lo ngại hơn."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用OpenAPS的所有預測的組合範圍，並為您提供可能的預測範圍。這個選項已顯示能減少對算法預測的困惑和壓力，提供了較不擔憂的可視化表示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uses the fairly established Time in Tight Range definition, which is defined as time between %@ and %@  %@." : {
      "comment" : "Time in Tight Range (TITR) verbose hint description",
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Uses the fairly established Time in Tight Range definition, which is defined as time between %1$@ and %2$@  %3$@."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bruger den rimeligt etablerede tid i Tight Range definition, som er defineret som tid mellem %1$@ og %2$@  %3$@."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Verwendet die relativ gängige Definition der \"Time in Tight Range\", die als Zeit zwischen %1$@ und %2$@ %3$@ definiert ist."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Uses the fairly established Time in Tight Range definition, which is defined as time between %1$@ and %2$@  %3$@."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Uses the fairly established Time in Tight Range definition, which is defined as time between %1$@ and %2$@  %3$@."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Utilise la définition désormais bien établie du temps dans la plage cible étroite (TITR), correspondant à la durée pendant laquelle la mesure de glucose se situe entre %1$@ et %2$@ %3$@."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Uses the fairly established Time in Tight Range definition, which is defined as time between %1$@ and %2$@  %3$@."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Uses the fairly established Time in Tight Range definition, which is defined as time between %1$@ and %2$@  %3$@."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
