    "When \"Super Bolus\" is selected in the bolus calculator, your current basal rate multiplied by \"Super Bolus Percentage\" will be added to your bolus recommendation." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "When \"Super Bolus\" is selected in the bolus calculator, your current basal rate multiplied by \"Super Bolus Percentage\" will be added to your bolus recommendation."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Når \"Super Bolus\" er valgt i bolusregnemaskinen, vil din aktuelle basale sats ganget med \"Super Bolus Procent\" blive tilføjet til din bolus anbefaling."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn im Bolusrechner \"Superbolus\" ausgewählt ist, wird Deine aktuelle Basalrate mit dem \"Superbolus-Prozentsatz\" multipliziert und zu Deiner Bolusempfehlung hinzugefügt."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuando se selecciona \"Super Bolus\" en la calculadora de bolos, su tasa basal actual multiplicada por \"Super Bolus Percentage\" se añadirá a su recomendación de bolo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lorsque « Super Bolus » est sélectionné dans le calculateur de bolus, votre débit basal actuel multiplié par le « Pourcentage de Super Bolus » sera ajouté au bolus recommandé."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "When \"Super Bolus\" is selected in the bolus calculator, your current basal rate multiplied by \"Super Bolus Percentage\" will be added to your bolus recommendation."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Quando viene selezionato \"Super Bolo\" nella calcolatrice del bolo, la velocità basale corrente moltiplicata per \"Super Bolo percentuale\" sarà aggiunta alla tua raccomandazione in bolo."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "When \"Super Bolus\" is selected in the bolus calculator, your current basal rate multiplied by \"Super Bolus Percentage\" will be added to your bolus recommendation."
          }
        },
        "nb-NO" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Når \"Super Bolus\" er valgt i boluskalkulatoren, vil den nåværende basalraten multiplisert med \"Super Bolus Prosent\" legges til bolusanbefalingen."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wanneer \"Super Bolus\" is geselecteerd in de boluscalculator, zal uw huidige basaalstand vermenigvuldigd met \"Super Bolus Percentage\" worden toegevoegd aan uw aanbeveling voor bolus."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Po wybraniu opcji \"Super bolus\" w kalkulatorze bolusa, twoja bieżąca dawka bazowa pomnożona przez \"Super Bolus Procent\" zostanie dodana do rekomendacji bolusa."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Quando \"Super Bolus\" for selecionado na calculadora de bolus, a sua taxa de basal atual multiplicada por \"Super Porcentagem de Bolus\" será adicionada à sua recomendação de bolus."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "När \"Superbolus\" väljs i boluskalkylatorn kommer din nuvarande basalhastighet multiplicerad med \"Superbolusprocent\" att läggas till i din bolusrekommendation."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "When \"Super Bolus\" is selected in the bolus calculator, your current basal rate multiplied by \"Super Bolus Percentage\" will be added to your bolus recommendation."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Коли вибрано \"Super Bolus\" з калькулятором, ваша поточна базова ставка помножена на \"Super Bolus Percentage\" буде додана до вашої рекомендації."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Khi chọn \"Super Bolus\" trong tính toán bolus, tỷ lệ cơ bản hiện tại của bạn nhân với \"Tỷ lệ siêu Bolus\" sẽ được thêm vào khuyến nghị bolus của bạn."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "當在注射計算器中選擇「超級注射」時，您的當前基礎率乘以「超級注射百分比」將會加到您的注射建議中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When connected, uploading of carbs, bolus, basal and glucose from Trio to your Tidepool account is enabled.\n\nUse your Tidepool credentials to login. If you dont already have a Tidepool account, you can sign up for one on the login page." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "When connected, uploading of carbs, bolus, basal and glucose from Trio to your Tidepool account is enabled.\n\nUse your Tidepool credentials to login. If you dont already have a Tidepool account, you can sign up for one on the login page."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Når tilsluttet, upload af kulstof, bolus, basal og glucose fra Trio til din Tidepool konto er aktiveret.\n\nBrug dine Tidepool legitimationsoplysninger til at logge ind. Hvis du ikke allerede har en Tidepool konto, kan du tilmelde dig en på login-siden."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn die Verbindung hergestellt ist, ist das Hochladen von Kohlenhydraten, Bolus, Basalrate und Glukose von Trio auf Dein Tidepool-Konto aktiviert.\n\nVerwende Deine Tidepool-Zugangsdaten zur Anmeldung. Wenn Du noch kein Tidepool-Konto hast, kannst Du auf der Anmeldeseite ein Konto einrichten."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "When connected, uploading of carbs, bolus, basal and glucose from Trio to your Tidepool account is enabled.\n\nUse your Tidepool credentials to login. If you dont already have a Tidepool account, you can sign up for one on the login page."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le téléversement (uploading) des glucides, bolus, débits de base et glucose de Trio vers votre compte Tidepool sera activé une fois connecté. \n\nConnectez-vous donc avec vos identifiants Tidepool. Si vous n'avez pas encore de compte Tidepool, vous pourrez en créer un sur la page de connexion."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "When connected, uploading of carbs, bolus, basal and glucose from Trio to your Tidepool account is enabled.\n\nUse your Tidepool credentials to login. If you dont already have a Tidepool account, you can sign up for one on the login page."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Quando connesso, il caricamento di carboidrati, bolo, basale e glucosio dal Trio al tuo account Tidepool è abilitato.\n\nUsa le tue credenziali di Tidepool per effettuare il login. Se non hai già un account Tidepool, puoi registrarne uno nella pagina di login."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "When connected, uploading of carbs, bolus, basal and glucose from Trio to your Tidepool account is enabled.\n\nUse your Tidepool credentials to login. If you dont already have a Tidepool account, you can sign up for one on the login page."
          }
        },
        "nb-NO" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Når du er tilkoblet, er opplasting av karbohydrater, bolus, basal og blodsukker fra Trio til Tidepool-kontoen din aktivert.\n\nBruk Tidepool-påloggingsinformasjonen din for å logge inn. Hvis du ikke allerede har en Tidepool-konto, kan du registrere deg på innloggingssiden."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wanneer verbonden is is het uploaden van koolhydraten, bolus, basaal en glucose van Trio naar je Tidepool account ingeschakeld.\n\nGebruik je Tidepool referenties om in te loggen. Als je nog niet een Tidepool account hebt, kun je je aanmelden voor één op de login pagina."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Po podłączeniu, wgrywanie węglowodanów, bolus, bazy i glukozy z Trio na Twoje konto Tidepool jest włączone.\n\nUżyj swoich danych logowania do Tidepool do logowania. Jeśli nie masz już konta Tidepool możesz zarejestrować się na stronie logowania."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "When connected, uploading of carbs, bolus, basal and glucose from Trio to your Tidepool account is enabled.\n\nUse your Tidepool credentials to login. If you dont already have a Tidepool account, you can sign up for one on the login page."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "När du är ansluten aktiveras löpande uppladdning av kolhydrater, bolus, basal och glukos från Trio till ditt Tidepool-konto.\n\nAnvänd dina Tidepool-uppgifter för att logga in. Om du inte redan har ett Tidepool-konto kan du registrera dig på inloggningssidan."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "When connected, uploading of carbs, bolus, basal and glucose from Trio to your Tidepool account is enabled.\n\nUse your Tidepool credentials to login. If you dont already have a Tidepool account, you can sign up for one on the login page."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "При підключенні до Вашого облікового запису Tidepool завантажуються вуглець, баси та глюкози з Тріо до Вашого облікового запису Tidepool увімкнено.\n\nВикористовуйте ваші облікові дані Tidepool для входу. Якщо ви не маєте вже облікового запису Tidepool ви можете зареєструватися на одній сторінці входу."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Khi được kết nối, việc tải carbs, bolus, basal và glucose từ Trio lên tài khoản Tidepool của bạn sẽ được bật.\n\nSử dụng thông tin đăng nhập Tidepool của bạn để đăng nhập. Nếu bạn chưa có tài khoản Tidepool, bạn có thể đăng ký một tài khoản trên trang đăng nhập."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "連線時，從Trio上傳碳水化合物、注射、基礎及血糖到您的Tidepool帳號已啟用。\n\n使用您的Tidepool帳號登入。如果您尚未擁有Tidepool帳號，可以在登入頁面註冊。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
