    "Your profile basal insulin will be adjusted with the override percentage and your profile ISF and CR will be inversly adjusted with the percentage." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Your profile basal insulin will be adjusted with the override percentage and your profile ISF and CR will be inversly adjusted with the percentage."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Din profil basalinsulin vil blive justeret med overskrivningsprocenten, og din profil ISF og CR vil blive omvendt justeret med procentdelen."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein Profil Basalinsulin wird mit dem Override-Prozentsatz und Dein Profil-ISF und -CR werden umgekehrt mit dem Prozentsatz angepasst."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your profile basal insulin will be adjusted with the override percentage and your profile ISF and CR will be inversly adjusted with the percentage."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Su perfil de insulina basal se ajustará con el porcentaje de anulación y su perfil ISF y CR se ajustará inversamente con el porcentaje."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Votre profil basal sera ajusté selon le pourcentage de la Dérogation, tandis que votre Facteur de Sensibilité à l’Insuline (ISF) et votre Ratio Insuline/Glucides (CR) seront ajustés de manière inverse."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Your profile basal insulin will be adjusted with the override percentage and your profile ISF and CR will be inversly adjusted with the percentage."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il profilo dell’insulina basale sarà regolato con la percentuale di override e invece il profilo ISF e CR sarà regolato in maniera inversamente proporzionale alla percentuale."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Your profile basal insulin will be adjusted with the override percentage and your profile ISF and CR will be inversly adjusted with the percentage."
          }
        },
        "nb-NO" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Profilens basaldose vil bli justert med prosentsatsen og profilens ISF og CR vil bli omvendt justert med prosentsatsen."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Je basale insuline zal worden aangepast met het overschrijvingspercentage en uw ISF en CR profiel zullen direct worden aangepast aan het percentage."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bazowa wartość insuliny w Twoim profilu zostanie dostosowana o procent nadpisania, a ISF i CR w Twoim profilu zostaną odwrotnie dostosowane o procent."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A insulin basal do seu perfil será ajustada com a porcentagem de substituição e o seu ISF e CR serão inversamente ajustados com a percentagem."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Din vanliga basal kommer att justeras procentuellt enligt ovan, medan din normala insulinkänslighet (ISF) och insulinkvot (CR) kommer att bli omvänt justerade."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Your profile basal insulin will be adjusted with the override percentage and your profile ISF and CR will be inversly adjusted with the percentage."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ваш профіль базального інсуліну буде скоригований з урахуванням відсотка перевизначення, а ваші профілі ISF і CR будуть скориговані пропорційно цьому відсотку."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Liều basal sẽ được điều chỉnh theo tỷ lệ phần trăm ghi đè trong khi ISF và CR sẽ được điều chỉnh ngược lại."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "您的個人設定基礎胰島素將根據覆蓋比例進行調整，而您的個人設定ISF和CR也將根據百分比反向調整。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your profile basal insulin will be adjusted with the override percentage and your profile ISF and CR will be inversly adjusted with the percentage.\n\nIf you toggle off the override every profile setting will return to normal." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Your profile basal insulin will be adjusted with the override percentage and your profile ISF and CR will be inversly adjusted with the percentage.\n\nIf you toggle off the override every profile setting will return to normal."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Din profil basalinsulin vil blive justeret med overskrivningsprocenten, og din profil ISF og CR vil blive omvendt justeret med procentdelen.\n\nHvis du slår alle profilindstillinger fra, vil de vende tilbage til normal."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein Profil Basalinsulin wird mit dem Prozentsatz der Override angepasst und Dein Profil ISF und CR wird umgekehrt an den Prozentsatz angepasst.\n\nWenn Du die Override ausschaltest, wird jede Profileinstellung wieder normal sein."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Your profile basal insulin will be adjusted with the override percentage and your profile ISF and CR will be inversly adjusted with the percentage.\n\nIf you toggle off the override every profile setting will return to normal."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Votre profil basal sera ajusté selon le pourcentage de la Dérogation, tandis que votre Facteur de Sensibilité à l'Insuline (ISF) et votre Ratio Insuline/Glucides (CR) seront ajustés de manière inverse. \n\nSi vous désactivez cette Dérogation, tous les réglages du Profil reviendront à la normale."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Your profile basal insulin will be adjusted with the override percentage and your profile ISF and CR will be inversly adjusted with the percentage.\n\nIf you toggle off the override every profile setting will return to normal."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il profilo dell’insulina basale sarà regolato con la percentuale di override e il profilo ISF e CR sarà regolato inversamente con la percentuale.\n\nSe disattivi l'override di ogni impostazione del profilo tornerà alla normalità."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Your profile basal insulin will be adjusted with the override percentage and your profile ISF and CR will be inversly adjusted with the percentage.\n\nIf you toggle off the override every profile setting will return to normal."
          }
        },
        "nb-NO" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Profilens basalinsulin vil bli justert med overstyringsprosenten, og profilens ISF og CR vil bli inverst justert med prosenten.\n\nHvis du slår av overstyringen, vil alle profilinnstillinger gå tilbake til normalen."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Je basale insuline zal worden aangepast met het overschrijvingspercentage en je ISF en CR profiel zullen ineens worden aangepast met het percentage.\n\nAls je de overschrijving uitschakelt, keert elke profielinstelling naar normaal."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bazowa insulina Twojego profilu zostanie dostosowana za pomocą procentu nadpisania, a ISF i CR Twojego profilu zostaną odwrotnie dostosowane o procent.\n\nJeśli wyłączysz nadpisanie, wszystkie ustawienia profilu powrócą do normy."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Your profile basal insulin will be adjusted with the override percentage and your profile ISF and CR will be inversly adjusted with the percentage.\n\nIf you toggle off the override every profile setting will return to normal."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dina profilinställningar kommer att justeras utifrån procentsatsen i overriden. Basalinsulin kommer att justeras enligt procentsatsen, och din ISF och CR kommer att justeras omvänt utifrån procentsatsen.\n\nOm du stänger av overriden kommer dina profilinställning att återgå till det normala."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Your profile basal insulin will be adjusted with the override percentage and your profile ISF and CR will be inversly adjusted with the percentage.\n\nIf you toggle off the override every profile setting will return to normal."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Your profile basal insulin will be adjusted with the override percentage and your profile ISF and CR will be inversly adjusted with the percentage.\n\nIf you toggle off the override every profile setting will return to normal."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hồ sơ insulin cơ bản của bạn sẽ được điều chỉnh theo tỷ lệ ghi đè và hồ sơ ISF và CR của bạn sẽ được điều chỉnh ngược lại theo tỷ lệ phần trăm. Nếu bạn tắt ghi đè, mọi cài đặt hồ sơ sẽ trở lại bình thường."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "您的個人設定基礎胰島素將根據覆蓋比例進行調整，而您的個人設定ISF和CR也將根據百分比反向調整。\n\n如果您關閉覆蓋，所有個人設定將恢復正常。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your pump and CGM configurations are retained and fully functional." : {
